 r←Test_Misc_024(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;successFlag;msg
⍝ Exercise `PerformConfigChecks`: more than one "=" in a Tatin dependency folder is invalid.
⍝ Used to be reported as valid, and `SplitTatinFolders` then crashed when the project was opened.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 (successFlag msg)←##.Cider.PerformConfigChecks ∆GetConfigForChecks'packages_dev=A=B'
 →T.PassesIf 0≡successFlag
 →T.PassesIf 0<≢msg

 ⍝ Two adjacent "=" partition into two parts, so the count must be checked as well
 (successFlag msg)←##.Cider.PerformConfigChecks ∆GetConfigForChecks'packages_dev==TestCases'
 →T.PassesIf 0≡successFlag
 →T.PassesIf 0<≢msg

 r←T._OK
⍝Done
